%% -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
%% @doc Controls the production of WAMP meta events (wamp.session.*,
%% wamp.subscription.*, wamp.registration.* topics).
%% - demand (default): a meta event is produced only when at least one
%%   session (on any node) has a subscription matching the meta topic.
%%   Aggregate metrics are always maintained regardless.
